select app.guide_release_section('field', 'academy', 'chapter', 'my-hours-and-pay', 'Your training path is under **Me** > **Academy**: the handover, the return, cash and signing in the field, and the rules of the trip.

1. Open **Academy** and the first open section.
2. Press **Play** on each lesson: scenes with captions, read aloud by your phone''s own voice. **Pause**, **Back**, **Next**, **Replay** and Speed work as on a video. No voice on your phone? The captions play by themselves. Each section ends with a lesson called **See it**: pictures of the real screens with numbered pins, good and bad example photos, flow diagrams and Do and Do not pairs.
3. Answer the quiz and press **Check my answers**. Every question has one funny wrong answer among the options: picking it is simply wrong. 90% passes and opens the next section. Under that, the questions you got wrong are marked: **Fix the ones marked wrong** once and press **Check my fixes**; that check counts. Until you pass your path, the rest of the portal waits (the guide and your profile stay open).

> Tip: Nothing is downloaded: the lessons work on mobile data and use very little of it.

## Your first steps: Welcome (release 34)

Your first sign-in opens **Welcome**: welcome, then your profile and phone, then the academy, then your first tasks (press **Done** on each). Until you pass the academy, only Welcome, the academy, the guide and your profile open.

## Quiz rules (release 35)

A quiz passes at 90%, opens after the reading time, lets you fix the questions marked wrong once, waits 2 minutes after a failed try and allows 10 tries a day. You get field jobs only once you have passed and hold a shift that day.

## The renter''s side and Ask the guide first (release 48)

Your training now has the path **The renter''s side**: what the renter sees at each step, from the request to the deposit back, with each page of the renter guide (**Renter guide**, at `/staff/guide/renter`). Your field path also has a section of worked examples from this guide: the ready check, the original licence, cash and add-ons.

1. New staff take both from the start. Staff already working have 7 days: the academy page says the date; after it, the rest of the portal waits until they are passed.
2. **Ask the guide first**: the Assistant panel names the guide chapter of the page you are on. Read it before you call the office.', 'Academy', 'Your training: watch the lessons on your phone, pass each quiz.',
  'Your training path is under **Me** > **Academy**: the handover, the return, cash and signing in the field, and the rules of the trip.

1. Open **Academy** and the first open section.
2. Press **Play** on each lesson: scenes with captions, read aloud by your phone''s own voice. **Pause**, **Back**, **Next**, **Replay** and Speed work as on a video. No voice on your phone? The captions play by themselves. Each section ends with a lesson called **See it**: pictures of the real screens with numbered pins, good and bad example photos, flow diagrams and Do and Do not pairs.
3. Answer the quiz and press **Check my answers**. Every question has one funny wrong answer among the options: picking it is simply wrong. 90% passes and opens the next section. Under that, the questions you got wrong are marked: **Fix the ones marked wrong** once and press **Check my fixes**; that check counts. Until you pass the full academy, the rest of the portal waits (the guide and your profile stay open).

> Tip: Nothing is downloaded: the lessons work on mobile data and use very little of it.

## Your first steps: Welcome (release 34)

Your first sign-in opens **Welcome**: welcome, then your profile and phone, then the academy, then your first tasks (press **Done** on each). Until you pass the full academy, only Welcome, the academy, the guide, your profile and pay details and the documents to sign open; any other page brings you to the academy.

## Quiz rules (release 35)

A quiz passes at 90%, opens after the reading time, lets you fix the questions marked wrong once, waits 2 minutes after a failed try and allows 10 tries a day. You get field jobs only once you have passed and hold a shift that day.

## The renter''s side and Ask the guide first (release 48)

Customer service''s training has the path **The renter''s side** (release 50: not the field path any more): what the renter sees at each step, from the request to the deposit back, with each page of the renter guide (**Renter guide**, at `/staff/guide/renter`). Your field path also has a section of worked examples from this guide: the ready check, the original licence, cash and add-ons.

1. New staff take both from the start. Staff already working have 7 days: the academy page says the date; after it, the rest of the portal waits until they are passed.
2. **Ask the guide first**: the Assistant panel names the guide chapter of the page you are on. Read it before you call the office.

## The basics and your pay (release 50)

1. The full academy opens your portal: pass every section of the field path, and your jobs and shifts open.
2. The rest opens your pay: Finish the other sections before your pay is paid out. **My pay** says when a stub is held, and why.
3. Stuck on a page? When the **Stuck?** prompt opens, or a page keeps failing for you, that page''s academy section is given to you: that part of the portal waits until you pass it, and you get an alert with the link.',
